From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:56:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mb/lenovo/haswell: Put the display options in the setup

Show the firmware framebuffer size (gfx_fb_limit) and the display setup
at wake (gfx_resume_init) in Hardware > Graphics, after the graphics
memory options.

TEST=Built lenovo/w541 with mrc.bin and with the native RAM init.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
index 2e8fc3e085..591cd39e1a 100644
--- a/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
+++ b/src/mainboard/lenovo/haswell/cfr.c
@@ -541,6 +541,8 @@ static const struct sm_object hardware_graphics = SM_DECLARE_FORM({
 		&gfx_uma_size,
 		&gfx_uma_size_mrc,
 		&gfx_aperture_size,
+		&gfx_fb_limit,
+		&gfx_resume_init,
 		NULL
 	},
 });
